<title>USA: Getty Communications Plc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Getty Communications Plc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   0.02		     0.02</p>
<p> Net			    770			449</p>
<p> Revs			14,100		   12,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>		(Figures above in British pounds)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said the strength of the sterling during the quarter significantly impacted the sales in British pounds of non-UK operations.  Had the first quarter 1996 currency exchange rates been applied, sales would have been nine percent higher.</p>
</text>
